{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"739055626742661130","content":"<@!366565198284324868> \n\nVee is walking around a house. It feels strangely familiar. There is a fire going in the fire place. Suddenly a stray ember finds it was onto a nearby curtain, causing it to smolder then be set ablaze. Soon everything around Vee is on fire, burning everything it can. Vee runs. But the fire chases her, she can’t escape, the fire grows closer and closer as she runs faster and faster. Then everything stops. She is surrounded by darkness, nothing. Then, someone cries out “Vee!” She turns around. Suddenly she is surrounded once again by the flames, but on the other side she sees a figure. He seems familiar. He’s reaching out, begging for Vee to follow. Then he disappears. Gone without a trace. He leaves Vee behind. The flames begin to engulf her. -Vee wakes up-\n\nTake a point of exhaustion, you don't gain a long rest. This is your nightmare.\n\nReduce your max hp by:","created_at":"2020-08-06T09:38:45.099000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740866444908036127","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
